  "rules": [
    "Concept sheets are not final runtime atlases.",
    "Runtime key labels must be rendered by the engine from active bindings.",
    "Counts, cooldowns, fill amounts, and state text must not be baked into PNG assets.",
    "Panels and slots should use nine-slice scaling or renderer-native primitives.",
    "Every runtime import must preserve RGBA alpha and pass screenshot proof."
